:: Xavier Hang Out End Late High Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */
You are regaling <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> with a tale of recent adventure or daring on your behalf as the boy smiles and nods along, seemingly entertained by your story, when he suddenly stops in his tracks. You pause and turn around, asking him if something is wrong. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> looks at his watch in silence for a moment, before his eyes turn to you. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Very sorry, but it seems that time has come. You’ll have to finish this story next time.”</span><br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
        {
        Name: "Xavier",
        State: {
            Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
            Mouth: "Smirk",
            Eyes: "Tired",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

You ask if he means he has to go and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> nods. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Afraid I have a prior engagement back home. But do not fret, I’m sure we’ll hang out again soon.”</span> <span style="color:Pink">Suddenly, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> grabs you by the wrist and pulls you in close, smiling deviously,</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“In fact, I expect it. You are quite the entertaining boy, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$XavierNickname</span>. I look forward to our next little playdate.”</span> <span style="color:Pink">His smile causes a shiver to run up your spine.</span> <br>
<br>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "Ask him to stay out a little longer<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You gulp, nervously saying goodbye. You feel his hand on your lower back and twitch slightly, feeling a warmth building as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> stares into your eyes for a moment before suddenly releasing you. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You get nervous far too easily.”</span> He laughs, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But that’s what makes you so cute to tease. Have a good day, I’ll see you later.”</span><br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:LightGreen"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> gives you a wink before walking off. You are left there stunned for a minute watching him until you are able to snap back to your senses and begin to head off yourself.</span> <span style="color:Pink"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span>’s gaze is creepily enchanting sometimes.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>

	<<link "Give him a hug goodbye<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You smile, a bit nervous, but want to try and match <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span>’s teasing. Either that, or you don’t realize he is teasing and are simply an overly friendly boy. Regardless of your reason, you ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> for a hug goodbye, smiling and not showing a hint of fear. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> raises an eyebrow at this response before chuckling. <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Of course, can’t say goodbye without one.”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">He laughs, his tone changing to a more friendly one, as he pulls you in for a hug. You half expect his hand to go wandering down, but find the hug to be surprisingly normal.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I’ll see you later. Try not to have too much fun after I leave, hm?”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">He laughs as he waves goodbye.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>

    <<if $Player.Kinks.Slaveplay == 1 && $XavierSocial > 50>>
        <<link "Ask to go home with him<br>">>
        <<replace"#choice">>
            You gulp, a nervous voice building in your throat. <span style="color:Pink">Something about <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span>’s gaze causes your heart to beat quickly and you quietly ask if maybe you could go home with him.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> whispers, tilting his head slightly, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“That would be fun. Though, what kind of son would I be to just bring a friend home without permission? Then again, if you were just a toy bought to be used and played with-”</span> <span style="color:Pink"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span>’s hand falls to your stomach, rubbing it lightly,</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Just an object that I own. Now, I’m sure it wouldn’t be a problem then.”</span><br>

            <<set _ad to [
                {
                Name: "Player",
                State: {
                    Mouth: "Happy",
                    Blush: 2,
                    },
                },
                {
                Name: "Xavier",
                State: {
                    Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
                    Mouth: "Smirk",
                    Eyes: "Tired",
                    },
                },
            ]>>
            <<ad _ad>>

            <span style="color:Pink">You feel his hand go lower, slipping into the front of your bottoms just an inch.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But objects don’t have free will. And toys do whatever I say… and they don’t wear clothes. Would you like to be my toy?”</span> <span style="color:Pink"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> whispers, his fingers tickling your pubic area just above your crotch.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hmmm, maybe next time.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> suddenly releases you, stepping back as you breathe in heavily. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But I really have to be going, I’ll see you later though.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span>’s voice returns to normal, or at least what he presents as normal, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Try not to have too much fun without me.”</span> He chuckles before walking off, <span style="color:Pink">leaving you standing there with your heart in your throat.</span> <br>
            <br>
            [[Continue|Park]]
        <</replace>>
        <</link>>
    <</if>>
</div>